  "*** DRACULA IS ALL-POWERFUL! ***": {
    "translation": "德古拉无所不能"
  },
  "*** YOU MUST AIM FOR THE HEAD TO DEFEAT HIM! ***": {
    "translation": "你必须瞄准头部才能击败他"
  },
  "DRACULA:Oh, but this world invited me.": {
    "translation": "德古拉:哦,但这个世界邀请了我"
  },
  "DRACULA:Your own kind called me forth with praise and tribute.": {
    "translation": "德古拉:你的同类用赞美和贡品召唤了我"
  },
  "DRACULA:Freedom is always sacrificed to faith, good hunter.": {
    "translation": "德古拉:自由总是被献祭给信仰,好猎人"
  },
  "DRACULA:Or are you truly here by choice?": {
    "translation": "德古拉:还是你真的自愿来到这里?"
  },
  "DRACULA:Ha! Mankind. A cesspit of hatred and lies.": {
    "translation": "德古拉:哈!人类,一个仇恨和谎言的粪坑"
  },
  "RICHTER:Dracula. Die now, and leave this world. You'll never belong here!": {
    "translation": "里希特:德古拉,现在就死吧,离开这个世界,你永远不属于这里"
  },
  "RICHTER:Tribute? You're a thief. You steal men's souls, their freedom...": {
    "translation": "里希特:贡品?你是个小偷,你偷走人们的灵魂和自由"
  },
  "RICHTER:All I'm here for is you. To hell with your heresy!": {
    "translation": "里希特:我来这里只为了你,让你的异端见鬼去吧"
  },
  "RICHTER:You're nothing but a blight on mankind.": {
    "translation": "里希特:你不过是人类的祸害"
  },
